\section platformrte_docs_templates_03_CONFIGURATION_MANAGEMENT_PLAN_5_change_control_process 5. Change Control Process

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_03_CONFIGURATION_MANAGEMENT_PLAN_51_change_request_workflow 5.1 Change Request Workflow

```
1. IDENTIFY
   Developer identifies issue/feature
   Creates GitHub Issue with description

2. EVALUATE
   Team reviews issue
   Assigns priority (P1/P2/P3/P4)
   Estimates effort

3. PLAN
   Assign to developer/team
   Add to milestone/release
   Link related issues

4. IMPLEMENT
   Create feature branch: git checkout -b feature/issue-42
   Make changes (commits with good messages)
   Write/update tests

5. TEST
   Unit tests passing
   Code review by peer (min. 2 reviewers for SIL 4)
   Static analysis (cppcheck)
   All checks pass

6. VERIFY
   Second reviewer approves changes
   CM manager verifies version labels
   Tests confirmed passing

7. INTEGRATE
   Merge to develop branch
   Close issue
   Update CHANGELOG

8. RELEASE
   Create release tag: v0.1.0
   Build release artifacts
   Tag version in git
```

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_03_CONFIGURATION_MANAGEMENT_PLAN_52_change_control_board_ccb 5.2 Change Control Board (CCB)

**Composition:**
- Project Manager (chair)
- Functional Safety Manager
- Lead Architect
- QA/Test Lead
- CM Manager

**Meeting:** Monthly (or as-needed for critical issues)

**Decisions:**
- ✅ Approve/reject change requests
- ✅ Prioritize changes
- ✅ Approve baseline modifications
- ✅ Release authorization

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_03_CONFIGURATION_MANAGEMENT_PLAN_53_emergency_changes_hotfixes 5.3 Emergency Changes (Hotfixes)

**Process for critical production bugs:**

```
1. Create hotfix branch: git checkout -b hotfix/security-42
2. Fix and test thoroughly
3. Merge to main (production) and develop (integration)
4. Tag as patch release: v0.1.1
5. Backport to all active releases
6. CCB reviews in next meeting
```

